            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 7:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mutaba nka baashwenkuriimwe, abu baanabi aba ira baabaire bagambira n'eiraka rihango bati: Mugarukye, murekye emitwarize yaanyu mibi, n'ebibi ebi murikukora. Kwonka baayanga kumpurira, n'obu kwakuba okuunyetaho; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 14:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.8.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 8:52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu, baashwenkuriimwe barahi? Na baanabi, nimugira ngu batuuraho ebiro byona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
