        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nyine ekiniga kingi ahabw'amahanga agataine ki geetaireho; ahabw'okuba ku naagwereirwe kubi kakye Abaisraeli, ago mahanga gaababonabonesa, gaarengyesereza. ",
