          "text": " Naamubuuza nti: Bariya baija kukora ki? Yangarukamu ati: Ago nigo mahembe agaataataaniise Yuda, hakabura owaimutsya omutwe, kandi abo baheesi baizire kutiinisa amahanga agaimukize amahembe gaago kurwanisa ensi ya Yuda kugitaataanisa, n'okuteera ahansi ago mahembe.",
